  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.3.1p1:1248-976ffae31c\nDescription of the bug:\nAfter the 10/12/2022 update on Oculus PC, my favorite avatars in VRC+ Group 4 and 5 do not show up in VRChat even though they appear in my recently used and show as favorited when I select them. \nThe avatars in these groups show on the VRChat website without issue.\nI have cleared my cache and restarted VRChat multiple times but the avatars in these groups still will not show up in-game.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): \nUpdated VRChat on Oculus PC app on 10/12/2022, opened game, opened avatar menu, and navigated to VRC+ Group 4 and 5 which appear empty.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):",
